02:04.904">'till</span> <span begin="02:04.904" end="02:05.290">we're</span> <span begin="02:05.290" end="02:07.842">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">激荡着我们的灵魂 直至我们融为一体</span></p><p begin="02:08.417" end="02:13.569" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="02:08.417" end="02:08.692">Then</span> <span begin="02:08.692" end="02:09.035">soft</span> <span begin="02:09.035" end="02:09.387">as</span> <span begin="02:09.387" end="02:09.584">sha</span><span begin="02:09.584" end="02:10.214">dows</span> <span begin="02:10.214" end="02:10.459">we'll</span> <span begin="02:10.459" end="02:10.617">be</span><span begin="02:10.617" end="02:13.569">come</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随后化作暗影般轻柔的存在</span></p><p begin="02:39.197" end="02:43.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="02:39.197" end="02:39.532">We'll</span> <span begin="02:39.532" end="02:39.854">see</span> <span begin="02:39.854" end="02:40.053">cre</span><span begin="02:40.053" end="02:40.362">a</span><span begin="02:40.362" end="02:40.692">tion</span> <span begin="02:40.907" end="02:41.294">come</span> <span begin="02:41.294" end="02:41.811">un</span><span begin="02:41.811" end="02:43.817">done</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们将亲眼目睹 造物迈向毁灭</span></p><p begin="02:44.920" end="02:49.586" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="02:44.920" end="02:45.159">These</span> <span begin="02:45.159" end="02:45.509">bones</span> <span begin="02:45.509" end="02:45.836">that</span> <span begin="02:45.836" end="02:46.197">bound</span> <span begin="02:46.197" end="02:46.548">us</span> <span begin="02:46.548" end="02:46.921">will</span> <span begin="02:46.921" end="02:47.067">be</span> <span begin="02:47.067" end="02:49.586">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">束缚着我们的骨骼 终将随风而散</span></p><p begin="02:52.172" end="02:55.229" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="02:52.172" end="02:52.539">Come</span> <span begin="02:52.539" end="02:52.916">un</span><span begin="02:52.916" end="02:55.229">done</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">走向覆灭的深渊</span></p><p begin="03:07.611" end="03:11.951" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="03:07.611" end="03:07.931">These</span> <span begin="03:07.931" end="03:08.066">bones</span> <span begin="03:08.066" end="03:08.336">that</span> <span begin="03:08.336" end="03:08.682">bound</span> <span begin="03:08.682" end="03:09.019">us</span> <span begin="03:09.019" end="03:09.386">will</span> <span begin="03:09.386" end="03:09.541">be</span> <span begin="03:09.541" end="03:11.951">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">束缚着我们的骨骼 终将化作灰烬</span></p><p begin="03:12.910" end="03:17.812" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="03:12.910" end="03:13.237">We'll</span> <span begin="03:13.237" end="03:13.587">stir</span> <span begin="03:13.587" end="03:13.906">our</span> <span begin="03:13.906" end="03:14.282">spi</span><span begin="03:14.282" end="03:14.633">rits</span> <span begin="03:14.633" end="03:14.982">'till</span> <span begin="03:14.982" end="03:15.563">we're</span> <span begin="03:15.563" end="03:17.812">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">激荡着我们的灵魂 直至我们融为一体</span></p><p begin="03:17.812" end="03:18.058" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="03:17.812" end="03:18.058">Go!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧！</span></p><p begin="03:20.656" end="03:20.786" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="03:20.656" end="03:20.786">Go!</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="03:20.783" end="03:20.934"><span begin="03:20.783" end="03:20.934">(Go!)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧！</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧！</span></p><p begin="03:26.218" end="03:26.955" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="03:26.218" end="03:26.565">Let's</span> <span begin="03:26.565" end="03:26.955">go!</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="03:2